{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205080","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1820508001:1":{"text":"向こうのあの辺がよさそう！茂みが多いし、岩陰にも隠れやすいし、待ち伏せ……じゃなかった、悪戯を仕掛けるにはぴったりよ。","source_cn":"远处那块地段比较合适！周围树丛茂密，巨石的分布容易形成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA20911AEEB5A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820508002:1":{"text":"任せるよ！道中でよさそうな素材を集めて、どこかでカボチャの幽霊を作ろう。","source_cn":"听你的！我们沿路寻找素材，再找块地方提前做好“南瓜幽灵”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D9959E928A0F64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820508003:1":{"text":"ここなら、カボチャよりも恐ろしいものがたくさん転がってるはずだ！","source_cn":"放心吧，这里肯定有许多比南瓜还恐怖的东西，肯定能派上用场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45CE7C4991FC2E34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"セリス","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:里纳":{"text":"レナード","source":"里纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}